  "pr_number": 15268,
  "title": "fix: restore Vertex primary routes for Gemini",
  "author": "ElliotEtag",
  "url": "https://github.com/pollinations/pollinations/pull/15268",
  "merged_at": "2026-09-21T16:29:53Z",
  "labels": [],
  "pr_body_excerpt": "## Summary\n\n- Routes six Gemini text models and four Gemini image models directly through Vertex AI.\n- Keeps the best observed OpenRouter route per model as fallback, based on seven-day production error data.\n- Restores the proven Vertex request behavior from #12651 and #12708–#12712: native search, schema sanitization, image tiers, thinking, seeds, safety, and reference limits.\n- Adds strict usage validation and keeps normalized public usage in image metadata.\n- Fixes non-safety image failover, fallback tool-schema compatibility, and provider-neutral cache billing.\n\n## Pricing and routing notes\n\n- Token prices stay unchanged across primary and fallback routes.\n- Vertex adjustment pricing is now explicit: Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite grounded prompts are $0.036925 each (previously $0.01477 through OpenRouter), and Gemini 3.1 Pro cache storage is $4.7475 per 1M tokens for Vertex's one-hour TTL (previously $0.395625 for OpenRouter's five-minute TTL).\n- Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite intentionally uses Vertex `global` as primary; its proven OpenRouter `google-vertex/eu` route remains the fallback.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Gen full suite: 2,224 passed, 6 skipped; typecheck passed.\n- Enter full suite: 1,270 passed; affected pricing and fallback tests passed after the latest main merge.\n- Live Vertex probes: all 10 migrated models passed end to end.\n- Live 4K Gemini 3.1 Flash Image probe: HTTP 200, PNG, `STOP`, 2,520 image tokens.\n- Enter full typecheck still reports the pre-existing `ModelHealth.success_rate` mismatch in the unmodified model catalog.\n",
