    "blurb": "Six Gemini text models and four image models are back on their proven Vertex AI routes, with their best seven-day OpenRouter paths waiting in the hedge as fallbacks. The routing garden is once again growing the features Gemini actually brought.",
    "summary": "Restored Vertex AI as the primary route for six Gemini text models and four Gemini image models, preserving native search, schema sanitization, image tiers, thinking, seeds, safety controls, reference limits, validated usage, and per-model OpenRouter fallbacks.",
